    "doi": "10.1073/pnas.252342899",
    "title": "RNA interference-mediated silencing of Sod2 in Drosophila leads to early adult-onset mortality and elevated endogenous oxidative stress.",
    "authorString": "Kirby K, Hu J, Hilliker AJ, Phillips JP.",
